  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "aciR",
  "description": "Reimplements the assimilative causal inference (ACI) method of Andreou, Chen and Bollt (2026) <doi:10.1038/s41467-026-68568-0> for conditional Gaussian nonlinear systems (CGNS). Provides the closed-form forward filter and backward smoother for the conditional Gaussian statistics of an unobserved component given an observed signal, together with the relative-entropy causal-information metric that contrasts the smoother posterior against the filter posterior. The numerical core is graded against fixtures generated by an independent 'MATLAB' harness reproducing the deterministic core of the reference implementation.",
  "name": "aciR: Assimilative Causal Inference for Conditional Gaussian Nonlinear\n    Systems",
